WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.202
Emperor Kangxi decided to unify the whole island of Taiwan.

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:06.522
He sent the veteran general Shi Lang to lead the navy on the expedition.

00:00:06.522 --> 00:00:10.023
The dock was crowded with people seeing the navy off.

00:00:10.023 --> 00:00:13.390
Shi Lang was highly experienced and not nervous at all.

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:17.670
Riding the sea wind, the fleet arrived at the Penghu Islands.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:22.273
Shi Lang stood at the bow of the ship, gazing at the distant islands.

00:00:22.273 --> 00:00:26.322
Smoke filled the air over the sea as the great battle unfolded.

00:00:26.322 --> 00:00:29.798
The Zheng forces resisted fiercely, but were still defeated.

00:00:29.798 --> 00:00:33.748
Zheng Keshuang of Taiwan was a young ruler.

00:00:33.748 --> 00:00:36.475
He knew he could no longer hold out and decided to surrender peacefully.

00:00:36.738 --> 00:00:40.782
The elder ministers urged him to lay down his arms for the sake of the people.

00:00:40.782 --> 00:00:44.928
In the year 1683, Taiwan became part of the Qing dynasty's territory.

00:00:44.928 --> 00:00:47.782
The following year, the Qing dynasty established Taiwan Prefecture.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:52.170
Shi Lang personally welcomed them, and the scene was peaceful and solemn.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:56.393
Officials arrived in Taiwan to manage local affairs.

00:00:56.393 --> 00:00:59.355
Travel for people on both sides of the strait became more convenient.
